# Build context for the ledger-pipeline image. Patterns are relative to this directory and
# only match at the top level unless prefixed with **/ — keep the **/ forms for anything sensitive.

# --- Not part of the runtime image
.venv
tests
scripts
deploy
README.md
requirements-dev.txt
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
.gcloudignore
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache
**/node_modules
**/.DS_Store

# --- Ledger data: must never enter an image
**/*.xlsx
**/*.xlsm
**/*.xls
**/*.csv
**/*.docx
**/*.doc
**/*.pdf
**/*小组奉献资料库*
**/*Booklet*
preview_site/data/
preview_site/_archive/

# --- Credentials and secrets
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.env
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/*.pkcs12
**/*credentials*.json
**/*service_account*.json
**/*service-account*.json
**/client_secret*.json
**/token.json
**/tokens.json

# --- Terraform state/vars if one is ever dropped in here
**/.terraform
**/*.tfstate
**/*.tfstate.*
**/*.tfvars
